The capture engine (crates/fluxrs-core) is an independent Rust
implementation whose design follows Fluxzy.Core
(https://github.com/haga-rak/fluxzy.core, GPLv3).

Release packages ship WinDivert (https://github.com/basil00/WinDivert),
which is dual licensed under LGPLv3 / GPLv2; its license file is included
in the package as WinDivert-LICENSE.txt.
